      <title>Socar to Cut Italy Fuel Prices, Pre-Empting Meloni Windfall Tax</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-27/socar-to-cut-italy-fuel-prices-pre-empting-meloni-windfall-tax</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">41cdc92663f76b7b458d5ef1</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 17:05:27 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Azerbaijan’s Socar will cut fuel prices at its Italian service stations, a move that follows a similar commitment by Eni SpA and eases pressure on Premier Giorgia Meloni’s coalition to impose a windfall tax on energy companies ahead of the next election.</description>
